        </outputEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="completion_FAILED_GRADE">
        <description>Course failed — grade below pass mark at end of period - Enrolment period has ended or near end, final grade is below pass mark, and completion was never recorded. Student has failed the course for this enrolment period.</description>
